DomoDreams Panel — Licensing
============================

This repository contains components released under DIFFERENT licenses. Which
license applies depends on the component:

  * Home Assistant integration  →  custom_components/domodreams_panel/**
        MIT License (Section 1 below) — open source.

  * DomoDreams NSPanel Pro app   →  the Android APK distributed as a binary in
                                     this repository's GitHub Releases
        Proprietary (Section 2 below) — free to use, NOT open source.

  * Brand assets & screenshots   →  images/**, README media, DomoDreams name,
                                     logos and the panel's visual design
        Proprietary (Section 2 below).

Nothing in Section 1 grants any right to the app binary or the brand assets
covered by Section 2, and nothing in Section 2 restricts your MIT rights to the
integration source in Section 1.

